cific adjustment must be explicit."],"condition":"H.R. 2021 of the 119th Congress does not become law on or before 2027-01-14T23:59:59Z.","id":"not_enacted","label":"American Teacher Act not enacted"}],"condition_deadline":"2027-01-14T23:59:59Z","condition_resolution_note":"No condition resolver is registered. The proposed rule requires the exact H.R. 2021 (119th Congress) official enacted-law association plus a dated BecameLaw action, cross-checked against the law publication. Another legislative vehicle, S. 2481 or a later Congress does not satisfy this identity. After cutoff, absence of enactment needs a fresh complete official record. Missing, contradictory or boundary-day evidence lacking sufficient timestamp precision stays unresolved. January 14 is a chosen scenario cutoff, not a claimed constitutional last-presentment date.","exhaustive":true,"limitations":["Exploratory local-operator forecasts; neither prospective registration nor calibrated causal policy-effect estimates.","No automatic condition or numeric-outcome resolver is registered. These scenarios cannot enter ranks or training rewards.","NCES estimates a Fall 2030 release but has not supplied an exact day. Historical API means are current-vintage captures, not authenticated original-release prints.","Enactment can occur with amendments; the forecast assumes the introduced grant mechanism materially survives. Funding and implementation are modeled assumptions.","Public-school effects need not generalize to the full NT population. Indonesia and district-level Texas evidence do not identify a national U.S. NAEP effect.","The difference between marginal conditional forecast medians has no identified causal interpretation or uncertainty interval without a joint model."],"methodology":"paired_conditional_v1","outcome":{"country":"US","geography":"Nation (NT)","measure":"Main NAEP mathematics MRPCM composite; TOTAL; MN:MN mean on the 0-500 scale","measurement_period":"2030","name":"2030 NAEP grade 8 mathe